    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛程安排</>\n<Highlight>首场四方联赛</>将在开服<Highlight>第一周周日中午12:00</>通过对俱乐部的综合评判划分赛区、分组，并于<Highlight>当日晚18:00</>公示赛区以及分组。联赛以<Highlight>每两场对阵为一轮</>，每一轮持续<Highlight>两周</>，开服第一周周日晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启首轮联赛（特殊），后续调整为每周六晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启四方联赛。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛制规则</>\n每轮比赛由两场对阵组成。每轮第一场开始前，本组第1、2名，第3、4名，第5、6名以及第7、8名将分别进入不同的比赛小组，并在满足该规则的前提下<Highlight>随机分配</>。第一场比赛结束后，各比赛小组<Highlight>前2名进入胜者组</>，后2名进入败者组。第二场比赛将分别进行胜者组与败者组对决，并根据比赛结果确定本轮<Highlight>第1至第8名</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋降级规则</>\n每轮第二场比赛结束后，将于当周周六21:20进行本轮晋降级：<Highlight>圣名组及圣名组以上</>分组内前两名晋级上一分组，末两名降级至下一分组；<Highlight>英杰组及英杰组以下</>组内第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组。其中<Highlight>传奇组、史诗组、旅者组</>为特殊分组：传奇组第一、二名晋升一组，第六、七名均降一组，第八名降两组；史诗组第一、二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组；旅者组第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七、八名降级两组；挑战者组第一名晋升两组，第二、三名晋升一组。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>联盟组规则</>\n排名在旅者组之后的俱乐部将根据<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>划分至<Highlight>挑战者组</>（前八名）及后续<Highlight>联盟组</>（<Highlight>联盟组不参与升降级</>）。联盟组的俱乐部将在每场联赛开始前<Highlight>自动匹配</>其它俱乐部组成联盟，以联盟形式参与四方联赛，联盟内<Highlight>所有俱乐部成员</>均可入场参战，联盟中<Highlight>排名最高俱乐部的会长</>将在局内自动获得<Highlight>联赛指挥权限</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛季重置</>\n每个新赛季开始时联赛将<Highlight>重新划分赛区</>，届时将按照<Highlight>上一赛季联赛成绩</>重新匹配对手构建新的赛区。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide regions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs <Highlight> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening at 12:00 PM </>, and the regions and groups will be announced <Highlight> at 6:00 PM on the same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) starts at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week of server opening, and subsequent leagues are adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st and 2nd, 3rd and 4th, 5th and 6th, and 7th and 8th place teams in the group will be assigned to different match groups, and <Highlight> randomly assigned </> while meeting this rule. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the winner's bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the loser's bracket. The second match will feature winner's bracket and loser's bracket duels respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the match results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place at 9:20 PM on that Saturday: <Highlight> For the Saint Name group and above </>, the top two in the group are promoted to the previous group, and the bottom two are relegated to the next group; <Highlight> For the Hero group and below </>, the first in the group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups. Among them, <Highlight> the Legend, Epic, and Traveler groups </> are special groups: the first and second in the Legend group are promoted one group, the sixth and seventh are relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first and second in the Epic group are promoted one group, the seventh is relegated one group, and the eighth is relegated two groups; the first in the Traveler group is promoted two groups, the second is promoted one group, and the seventh and eighth are relegated two groups; the first in the Challenger group is promoted two groups, and the second and third are promoted one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance groups </> (<Highlight> Alliance groups do not participate in promotion or relegation </>) based on the <Highlight> total club Потусторонний score </>. Clubs in the Alliance group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance before each league starts, participating in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battle, and the <Highlight> president of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically obtain <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide regions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to build new regions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
